          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "In the early hours of __UFO_PROTECTED_000__, a group of witnesses reported seeing a strange object in the sky over __LOCATION__. The object was described as a bright, disc-shaped craft with lights flashing in a pattern that appeared to be intentional. It moved erratically, changing direction suddenly and gaining and losing altitude rapidly. The witnesses included __WITNESS_1, __WITNESS_2, and __WITNESS_3, all of whom were in the area for __REASON. They reported that the object remained visible for approximately __DURATION before disappearing suddenly. Local authorities were notified, but no official explanation or identification of the object has been provided. The incident is currently under investigation by __AGENCY.",
