          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "The VARIG plane, with call sign __VBF__, en route from Rio de Janeiro (RJ) to São Paulo (SP), consisting of the following crew: radio operator Nagib, co-pilot Rafael, reported at 17:17 local time (21:17 UTC) a height of 2250 meters (7410 feet) and a speed of 2100 feet per minute (640 m/min). At 18:18 local time (22:18 UTC), the plane was in the final approach to landing.",
